this Policy;
xxv. “Proposal Form” means the Master Policyholder’s statements in the proposal for this Policy submitted by
or on behalf of the Members along with any other information or documentation provided to Us prior to
inception of this Policy;
xxvi. “Register of Members” means the register of Members maintained by the Master Policyholder in
accordance with Section 6 of Part F of this Policy , which register shall stand updated from time to time

